WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.730
- How have you been entertaining yourself

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.563
to get through this time?

00:00:03.563 --> 00:00:05.250
What have you been doing?

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.633
- I watch Reality TV.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.693
- Oh, I love that.

00:00:08.693 --> 00:00:10.173
Wait, what's your favorite?

00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:12.267
- "Below Deck."

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:14.550
- "Below Deck," okay.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.630
- All franchises.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.013
Every single franchise.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.020
I have slipped into the DMs

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.541
of certain crew members
and who are now my friends.

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:26.081
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:27.960
- I love that.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.360
- I'm like an uber weirdo fan.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.373
And so I watched that.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.640
Started getting into "90 Day Fiance"

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.560
and all those franchises.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.073
Very interesting social study.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.780
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.120
- My friends are obsessed with that one.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.077
Well, I actually--
- It's an interesting one.

00:00:47.077 --> 00:00:49.590
- I actually heard about one of those.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.240
So I have a little surprise for you.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.893
So, can we see that?

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.800
- Christina, how you doing?

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.390
Captain Lee here from "Below Deck."

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.360
I just want to say thank
you for being such a big fan

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:05.040
and I want to encourage you
to stay strong and remember

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.570
that a good sailor never learned
a damn thing in calm seas.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.090
So I know you're gonna navigate
these waters just fine.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.369
And if you decide you
wanna set sail again,

00:01:14.369 --> 00:01:15.600
you just let me know

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.950
'cause we have a deck chair

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.230
with your name written all over it.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.063
All right.

00:01:20.063 --> 00:01:24.510
And if you'd like to DM me
sometime and just chat, I'm here.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.343
All right.

00:01:25.343 --> 00:01:26.176
Take care kiddo.

00:01:26.176 --> 00:01:27.298
Bye-bye.

00:01:27.298 --> 00:01:28.949
- Aww, I love my Lee.

00:01:28.949 --> 00:01:31.500
Oh my God, I'm tears in my eyes.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.730
I'm not kidding.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.553
I literally have tears in
my eyes, I love him so much.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.900
Kate had him send me a
video about, I don't know,

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.840
six, eight months ago and
it was just very sweet.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.010
But that's like, ah.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:51.480
Oh, Captain Lee, my angel.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.080
- I love you.
- God of the sea.

